Proof. Proposition A8-D. □

Property A8.6 (Execution Boundedness). Plan execution consumes bounded cycles.

Proof. Proposition A8-B. □

These are the A8 obligations. The Verifiable Agency Theorem's assumption A7 (composition rules bounded) is grounded.

